{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_vrtx_01QfEJAou9ymB1XiXUHrj9cy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. I wrote **`answers/07-011-prompt-compression.md`** covering:\n\n- **Framing:** Why interviewers ask (token cost + prefill latency both grow with prompt length; they want concrete technique knowledge, not \"write shorter prompts\")\n- **Answer — 4-layer compression stack:**\n  1. **Rerank → top-3 chunks** (lossless, 5–7× context reduction — highest ROI)\n  2. **Chunk-level summarization** (cached, 4–8× compression, small quality risk)\n  3. **LLMLingua / perplexity pruning** (2–5× lossy, 2–8% QA accuracy cost — restricted to non-regulated domains)\n  4. **Conversation history summarization** (rolling summary replaces raw turns)\n  5. **Output token optimization** (max_tokens + structured JSON, 30–50% output reduction at 3–10× cost multiplier)\n- **Concrete before/after math:** 6,800 → 1,400 tokens/query = 79% reduction = **$16,500/day saved** at GPT-4o pricing on 1M queries/day\n- **Key pitfalls:** Reaching for LLMLingua first without checking quality; ignoring that output tokens cost 3–10× more than input; blindly compressing system prompts without semantic audit"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":247,"cache_read_input_tokens":75709,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":247,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d6fff3fd-b86c-49d0-af61-d91ebb3abd9e","uuid":"501e204e-68a8-4f9f-b3ad-e5e75e906b5b"}
